1
00:00:01,375 --> 00:00:03,185
Previously on
The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:05,850
Please stop crying.

3
00:00:05,848 --> 00:00:08,948
I'm begging you.
I don't know what else to do.

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,620
My boobs are empty.

5
00:00:10,618 --> 00:00:12,388
Do you want lasagna?

6
00:00:16,891 --> 00:00:19,061
It's okay, it's okay.

7
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,490
Shh...

8
00:00:26,801 --> 00:00:29,971
What have we done?

9
00:00:34,676 --> 00:00:36,746
(Penny:)What... what's all this?

10
00:00:36,744 --> 00:00:39,174
(Leonard:)Well, it sounded like
you were having a rough day,

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,550
(Leonard:)so I wanted you to come home
to something nice.

12
00:00:41,549 --> 00:00:44,119
(Penny:)Oh, that is so thoughtful.

13
00:00:44,118 --> 00:00:45,688
(Leonard:)Hey, do you remember when
we went wine tasting

14
00:00:45,687 --> 00:00:46,957
(Leonard:)in Santa Barbara
and you said

15
00:00:46,955 --> 00:00:48,525
that was the best
rosé you'd ever had?

16
00:00:48,523 --> 00:00:50,953
(Penny:)Yeah, I remember
us driving up there,

17
00:00:50,959 --> 00:00:53,789
(Penny:)going to the winery and...

18
00:00:53,795 --> 00:00:55,765
(Penny:)that's it.

19
00:00:55,763 --> 00:00:57,163
(Leonard:)And this wine is why.

20
00:00:57,165 --> 00:00:59,265
(Penny:)Oh.

21
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:01,027
(Penny:)Hey, what smells so good?

